Bind Npc 24435 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14435 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 521 "[Descendant of Hero] The more, the merrier."
    Journal for karus "You must deliver invitations to the people of Moradon and get replies."
    Journal for elmorad "You must deliver invitations to the people of Moradon and get a reply."
    Collect 1 of 910211000
    Collect 1 of 910212000
    Collect 1 of 910213000

Requires player level >= 60 and quest 520 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 50000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Moradon Merchant]Shaimer is looking for you. Did the preparations not finish?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Moradon Merchant]Clark is looking for you. Did the preparations not finish?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Oh! <selfname>! I was able to finish it because of you. But ... There is still one thing missing,. Can I make one last request?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "There are still people missing that were invited! Could you go find them and get an answer from them?\n\nBring this invitation letter to [Merchant] Kaishan, [Daughter of Merchant] Menesia, [Chief of Mercenary] Kuger and bring the response."

On in_progress
    Say "Hmm? No reply yet?"

On claimable
    Show quest "You have brought three responces. But there are some problems to start the festival.\n\nNothing is for certain but the castle might be under attack. [Captain] Harugo is looking for you <selfname>, go find him."

On completed
    Say "The castle that was attacked, but you can learn more. [Captain] Falkwine sat find him by <selfname>, go check."
